MODULE: LagBoundedPullWaitsOnGate
TARGET: LagBounded
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: relief stops draining while pressure remains high
PERTURBS: ViewPull

--- FIND
    /\ lag' = lag - Min(lag, batch) /\ phase' = "offer"
--- REPLACE
    /\ lag' = IF pressure > 0 THEN lag ELSE lag - Min(lag, batch)
    /\ phase' = "offer" \* MUTATION: relief is gated by its own pressure.
--- END
